  "id": "prog-phul-upper-hypertrophy",
  "title": "PHUL – Upper Hypertrophy",
  "creator": "Brandon Campbell",
  "description": "Brandon Campbell's four-day upper/lower split: two heavy power days (3–5 reps on the big compounds) and two hypertrophy days (8–12 reps, more isolation), so every muscle is hit twice a week. Run Mon/Tue/Thu/Fri. Progress by adding weight when you hit the top of the rep range with a rep in reserve; the source gives no rest times, so 3 min is used on the 3–5 rep lifts and 90 s elsewhere. Set ranges (3–4) are modelled at the lower number, which the author suggests when starting.",
